   "note": "Extract the normalized mantissa of the low FP16 OR AVX10.1 element in xmm3/m16 using imm8 for sign control and mantissa interval normalization. Store the mantissa to xmm1 subject to writemask k1 and merge with the other elements of xmm2. Bits 127:16 of xmm2 are copied to xmm1[127:16].",
